WEBVTT

00:23:26.556 --> 00:23:31.556
And I'm curious how running this study
has changed the way you approach life

00:23:31.596 --> 00:23:34.556
and your own pursuit of happiness.

00:23:35.836 --> 00:23:37.956
RW: Oh, gosh.

00:23:37.956 --> 00:23:40.636
Well, one of the things
it's helped me with is the idea

00:23:40.676 --> 00:23:44.596
that everybody
has struggles in their life.

00:23:44.636 --> 00:23:46.516
That has been so meaningful to me

00:23:46.516 --> 00:23:49.636
because I can also look
at the world and say,

00:23:49.676 --> 00:23:52.356
"Gee, other people seem to have lives

00:23:52.396 --> 00:23:54.636
that have it all figured out
and perfect lives."

00:23:54.636 --> 00:23:57.236
It is so helpful to know

00:23:57.276 --> 00:23:59.316
that there isn't a person on the planet

00:23:59.356 --> 00:24:00.836
who doesn't have struggles.